Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1700,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}后来他们有了孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1650,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}家里的氛围开始变得很尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1600,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}里子经常感觉自己受到排挤
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.19,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1550,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}于是他们就来问我的父母
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.12,0:16:31.96,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1500,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}能不能收养她
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1800,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}但是我的父母平时也都
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1750,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}在国外跑各种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.22,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1700,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}没空照顾里子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1650,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}正好我又一直都说过想要一个妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:39.77,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\an4\pos(1600,560)\alpha&HFF&\t(0,200,\alpha&H00&)\frz270\fs36\fn@FZLanTingYuan-H-GBK\bord2\3c&H5257B4&}于是就住到我家里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.06,0:16:34.39,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,但是我父母也是常常在世界各地飞来飞去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.39,0:16:36.44,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没有时间照顾小里子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.44,0:16:38.73,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,而我以前也说过想要一个妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.07,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,于是就让小里子来跟我住了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:40.94,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.61,0:16:43.03,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,真是辛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.03,0:16:45.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,食人族不会太可怕了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.83,0:16:52.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那我送她去校门那边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.87,0:16:55.91,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好 我回教室咯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.91,0:16:58.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,小里子 下次见
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:01.09,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好 下次再见
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.67,0:17:05.76,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那么我就回去咯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:07.89,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,能一起吃中餐真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.89,0:17:08.93,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:11.31,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你能等我到放学吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:14.10,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,放学后要去工作
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.73,0:17:17.98,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,难道我们可以一起做杀手的工作了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.98,0:17:20.27,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我本来是打算回家后再一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.27,0:17:21.48,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,这样时间就省下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.48,0:17:22.77,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.77,0:17:23.86,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,声音太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.86,0:17:25.28,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.24,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,放学之前能不能请你不要太引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.24,0:17:29.53,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,找个地方躲起来等呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:32.87,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.99,0:17:34.83,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:37.04,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,只是觉得你穿这样大概没办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.04,0:17:38.37,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,很失礼耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:40.13,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,我是忍者哦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.13,0:17:42.25,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,你们其实是很显眼的一族吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:43.84,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,那是风评被害啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.84,0:17:44.84,Dial_CH,,0,0,0,,算了
